Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumble Ball
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effect of the rumble\Nball lasts three minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.97,0:02:03.60,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(733,644)\bord1.9\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(691,733,\1a&H00&)\t(3944,3986,\1a&HFF&)}The Skies of Drum
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.97,0:02:03.60,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(733,644)\c&HE7E6E5&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Skies of Drum
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the time I need to take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't defeat me in three\Nyears, let alone three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just three? Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just three?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be an interesting battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you old bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me up so I can help. Rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.92,0:02:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no match!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not against this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marimon Snow Melting Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock point! Light boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, just a transformation, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was expecting something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to show\Nare Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a zone type, just like Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're a reindeer human, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy point!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm a human reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:02:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I know everything\Nthere is to know about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the three form transformations\Nyou sometimes use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marimo's big super\Nsurprise Katorea hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of surprises, you've\Ngot none left to spring on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen all your forms now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing more than a\Npower fighter like Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's no way you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jumping point, jump, boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the jump on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, that guy can really jump. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that form?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this human and animal form\Nthe little reindeer from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guard point, they're boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another form?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:03:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hit you dead on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You zone types have a three-form limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rumble Ball is a\Nspecial pill that enhances
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the power of the Devil\NFruit's transformations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over five long years of research,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I discovered four additional\Ntransformation points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A-a seven-form transformation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A talking reindeer who can\Nchange into seven forms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend, what's the matter with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just so much happiness of meeting\Na transforming reindeer a guy can take!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about fighting me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be deceived by what\Nhas to be an obvious sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arm point, arm boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you thought that was something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should see what my iron\Nhose can do against rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my hammers! What nerf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These'll teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barmo's Super Surprise Katorea Axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow-Splitting Flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, damn, that reindeer\Ncan really take a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you dodged it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see you dodge! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the directional soul splitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna take me down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not fighting, you're just dosing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brain point, brain boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't just dodging your swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was looking for your weak spot. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll finish you. Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna shoot a beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No he won't, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's gotta be a beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know that, huh, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smart Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, what kind of beam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ginormous beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The castle's unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for my weak spot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got some news for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little transforming parlor\Ntricks can't save you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as you're about to find out,\Nyou're the one who's gonna be finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His jaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Race!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! All right! Wow! Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Where is he? Where's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tin-plated bastard, he's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well since his hippo got knocked away, I\Ndoubt he could have snuck off very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how? When'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably when you were drooling\Nover those transformations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sneaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think he ran off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not much up here, just the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Nami's all alone in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he lays a finger on her, I'll chop\Nhim up and feed him to the sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the nincompoop has a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I go away and this is what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drunk Castle used to be a stately palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:09:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's nothing but a run-down\Nhobble filled with snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did they do to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I won't let them get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chew them up until there's\Nabsolutely nothing left!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta get Vivi home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent enough time resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctorine doesn't seem to be around, so\Nmaybe I can slip away without her noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What the? Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, another Straw Hat, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, he doesn't look friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.47,0:09:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir, but I don't\Nknow what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm just a traveler who is passing\Nthrough, and I'm actually on my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:09:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king of this country\Ncommands you to starve!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you big creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have gained weight recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much, much, factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He turned into a bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, my miraculous bone structure\Nshaping technique is now complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leanin' mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to gobble you up, Straw Hat. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found you! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that guy Big Fatso before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you mind telling me\Nwhy the coat I kindly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loaned you is all torn\Nup before I murder you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how\Nmuch I paid for that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,28,800 berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was after hackling!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, I didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That loudmouth over there did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault he shot a cannon at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then in that case, Luffy,\NI guess I can forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.69,0:12:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known that\Nyou would have never brought
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it back in good condition\Nwhen I let you borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can just pay me back at my usual 300\N% interest, which comes to 100,000. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.16,0:12:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have said!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never have taken it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right, I still\Ngotta kick your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one doing the butt-kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind me lies this castle's arsenal, and\NI'm the only one who has the key to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside its walls are some of the\Nmost fearsome weapons known to man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is\Ndevour them Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then my munch-munch shock will\Nmake them part of my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'll be forced to\Nface a fearsome living
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weapon the likes of\Nwhich you've never seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:13:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready to die, Straw\NHats, because I'm going... Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's getting away! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I've got another trump card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be the key to the\Narsenal he was yapping about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, why couldn't it have been the\Nkey to this castle's treasure vault?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crawling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm great now that I've\Nseen you, Nami dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there are two things that'll\Nmake me feel even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could just rest my\Nhead on your warm billowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get away from\Nme, you stupid loudmouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.92,0:13:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The upper levels are full of snow, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trash my castle and defy\Nmy orders, will they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I taught those in\Nsupport, and it's a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A painful lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do so, I'll use the ultimate\Nweapon of the entire Trump Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My devastatingly lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tin Titan Royal Crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven Barrel Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got you cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, Rubberman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snowbird's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you laugh at me! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Ean. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He called me his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit I was skeptical when I\Nheard about this ropeway to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here it is, just like\Nthe young man told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't it used to be Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great view from this thing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but isn't it just the\Nteensiest bit overcrowded?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let Dalton go\Nalone when he's injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fight alongside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're so overloaded, it'll\Ntake forever to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta pedal faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, please just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol, who do you think you are, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no medicine that\Ncan cure fools, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.18,0:16:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you call me the king a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, do you think you're some hero who\Nspeaks for the lowly subjects of my kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A week in this cell will give you plenty\Nof time to reflect on your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing like prison\Nto change a man's attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just in case that doesn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have that rebellious\Nstreak beaten out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an excellent\Ngod the citizens trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologize to the king and\Nshow him respect, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dead Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk was an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you fell for his nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Risking your status\Nand insulting the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you a full pardon, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is get on your\Nknees and say they're following.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, oh great King Wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always know what's\Nright for this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with status!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare mock me too, stupid bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the king of drum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you're a\Nking, or even if you're a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you're someone who's\Ngreat or someone who's not so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna kick your lousy butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does matter, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trump Kingdom is a member\Nof the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means this is a capital\Noffense because I'm the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.00,0:18:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, Big Mouth, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King or no king, I'm taking you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take you down first, Strowhand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this will much,\Nmuch shock Tang Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, his tongue turned\Ninto a cannon! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help me lift him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, can you hear me? Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:18:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not until I put an end to Wobble\Nand what he's done to this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A government should care about\Nits country and its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you weren't joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you really think, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, a government doesn't\Nneed to have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just needs to control the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have patients who will\Ndie if I don't treat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw him in the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he resists, you have my\Npermission to shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of my patients at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who are going to suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with controlling the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And none of them are sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them what happens to a\Ncountry that doesn't have a heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once we arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because once I'm inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.10,0:20:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there'll be explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he let his guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pollock is talking. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain, it certainly seems\Nlike it's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to mess with that flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally going to kick your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a battle of the position!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's something going\Non on top of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.09,0:21:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drum Kingdom, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you vice king!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Drum Kingdom was ultimately\Ndefeated by the Skull and Crossbones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.66,0:22:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.06,0:22:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll brave whatever dangers lie ahead\Nand let you know when it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.80,0:23:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watching your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding behind it from one like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you even come if you're so scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always laugh at the face of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that, you moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.56,0:23:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't recognize you at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were more of Big\NMouse guards coming to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm really surprised you\Nguys came all the way up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not you, Zoro, but you, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you normally scared of doing\Nstuff like climbing mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever there's a towering peak\Nin front of me, I get to climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.22,0:23:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you, scaling that\Nmountain hand over hand was no picnic!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, we took a\Nropeway car up here, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami and Sanji, are they all right? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.62,0:24:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of them are just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.38,0:24:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to say, we took a\Nropeway car, but let me tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.78,0:24:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taking it was no picnic!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.82,0:24:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were on the way, then a giant condor\Nflew out of nowhere and attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.74,0:24:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what was that you were doing on\Ntop of the castle a few minutes ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.82,0:24:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating the crap out of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.56,0:24:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.78,0:24:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that person I saw flying\Nthrough the air was actually Wapol?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.28,0:24:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.62,0:24:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I threw a rope around his neck\Nand showed that bird who was boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.28,0:24:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, Captain Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.19,0:24:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his two henchmen,\Nwhat happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.26,0:24:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, the reindeer beat them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.94,0:24:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Those two? A reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.76,0:24:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.26,0:24:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a new friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you gotta meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.45,0:24:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.36,0:24:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.50,0:24:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A reindeer...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.42,0:25:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.04,0:25:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,STOP!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for those who had the\Nnerve to laugh at Heraluk's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.44,0:25:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without enough strength,\Nyou'd only die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.54,0:25:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.94,0:25:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sacrifice it for this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.26,0:25:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Nose, you never gave up, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.58,0:25:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still kept fighting, believing\Nin what this country could become.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.82,0:25:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, thanks to you, Drum\NKingdom, it can finally be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.45,0:26:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that strange\Ncreature behind that tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It almost looks like a reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.78,0:26:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.04,0:26:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.78,0:26:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.42,0:26:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Yeti! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.80,0:26:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk face!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.96,0:26:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a Yeti, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my new friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.14,0:26:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.52,0:26:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys scared him so bad, he ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.06,0:26:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bring him back so you\Ncan meet him, you jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.83,0:26:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back reindeer, I want to\Nintroduce you to my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.32,0:26:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop running for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.54,0:26:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my friends wouldn't meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.56,0:26:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just because I don't know you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.22,0:26:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.88,0:26:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends are back that way,\Ndon't you want to meet us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, this is for the best, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not so bad, you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.32,0:26:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back and meet them,\Nthey're my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends like yours,\NI don't need anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.24,0:27:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're\Ngoing to be okay, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.18,0:27:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just feeling a little drained, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.94,0:27:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.18,0:27:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.22,0:27:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's good to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.44,0:27:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be useful and take the\Ninjured guy to the medical ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you really should stay and\Nhave your illness completely treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.66,0:27:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't escape from here now, we won't\Nbe able to set sail for two more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.04,0:27:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how worried Vivi is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.66,0:27:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get her to Alabax.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.10,0:27:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit all this grumbling and\Nget back to the medical ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.26,0:27:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.66,0:28:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected, his injuries have\Ngotten worse due to overexertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.52,0:28:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, surely you would know\Nwhere the key to the arsenal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.48,0:28:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.46,0:28:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arsenal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you need to get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really none of\Nyour business, now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.36,0:28:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol always carried that key with\Nhim to keep it secure, he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.68,0:28:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, the key was likely\Nblown into the sky with him Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.92,0:28:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.88,0:28:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a shame Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.04,0:28:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ean
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.26,0:28:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think we can talk about your\Nfee for treating our crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.32,0:28:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you waive it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.54,0:28:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and could you go ahead and\Ndischarge me right now as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.94,0:28:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.02,0:28:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you should know better\Nthan that by now, girly?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.20,0:28:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my medical fee,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.74,0:28:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be taking all of the cargo and\Nmoney you have on that ship of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.20,0:28:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you will stay here and\Nrecover for two more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.20,0:28:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, she's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.64,0:28:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to complete your treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.40,0:28:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.31,0:28:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even feel like\NI'm going to die anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't exactly a\Nvery convincing reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.62,0:29:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key to the arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.44,0:29:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you needed, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.80,0:29:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you end up with that key?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.66,0:29:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's truly the real one,\Nhow'd you get a hold of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.76,0:29:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've certainly got some guts trying\Nto negotiate with me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.22,0:29:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are an unbelievably\Nfrustrating little girl, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.02,0:29:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.22,0:29:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pay my doctor's fee,\Nbut that's as much as I'll agree to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.04,0:29:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a doctor, I can't allow you\Nto leave in good conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.08,0:29:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.18,0:29:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.10,0:29:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm afraid\Nwe don't have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.20,0:29:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.30,0:29:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen here, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.94,0:29:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to leave you alone now\Nand go take care of a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.46,0:29:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look in the back room, you might\Nfind a dresser with one of my coats in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.30,0:29:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not exactly like I'm\Nposting any guards on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.18,0:29:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, the young man with the spinal fissure\Nshould be well enough to travel by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:29:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, girl, don't you even\Nthink about trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.74,0:30:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some heavy lifting for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.28,0:30:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she really just tell us to steal\Nher coat, get Sanji, and sneak out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.04,0:30:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it sounded like to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.50,0:30:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure have been running a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.08,0:30:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night came before I realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.44,0:30:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hear that rubber guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I finally shook him, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.98,0:30:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.76,0:30:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a full moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.22,0:30:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.78,0:30:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are still looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.60,0:30:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just give it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.10,0:30:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been tracking him forever,\Nand he still hasn't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.18,0:31:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not interested in becoming a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just going to have to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.78,0:31:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.26,0:31:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want the reindeer to\Nbe a pirate with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.70,0:31:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because you want something\Ndoesn't mean it's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.26,0:31:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't\Nwant to go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.10,0:31:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.36,0:31:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.27,0:31:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you are, reindeer, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.16,0:31:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.90,0:31:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.10,0:31:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing like them, the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.22,0:31:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.40,0:31:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're gonna come on our\Nship and be a pirate with us, kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.06,0:31:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.04,0:31:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you can't, reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.50,0:31:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a whole lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.86,0:31:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a very good argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.00,0:31:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.50,0:31:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a human, I'm a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have antlers and hooves, don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.24,0:32:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even have a blue nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've heard his story, do you\Nthink you can heal the scar on his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.66,0:32:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, maybe I do want to be a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.24,0:32:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't ever be one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.02,0:32:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not human! I'm a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.26,0:32:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be your friend and I can't\Nbecome a pirate on your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.50,0:32:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.44,0:32:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just here to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.20,0:32:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.84,0:32:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you asking\Nme to join your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.20,0:32:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really nice, so thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.08,0:32:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.16,0:32:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you wanted to, you could\Nstop by here again. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.56,0:32:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.48,0:33:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most people don't make friends\Nby telling someone to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life has been too still.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.56,0:33:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart is unfulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.20,0:33:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you could be the one to set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.84,0:33:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.96,0:33:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My world can be rearranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.72,0:33:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything as\Nlong as you are with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown stronger having you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.14,0:33:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've started on an everlasting ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.84,0:33:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible when your love is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.96,0:34:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you I have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.38,0:34:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far we can make this go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.94,0:34:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.24,0:34:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just right, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.22,0:34:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it shine in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.76,0:34:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glistening like water when\Nthe sun Rises in the dawn.

